## Description
For my final project, my program will allow the user to customize their own video game character by choosing their skin tone, hairstyle/color, clothing, etc. This is relevant to the arts because it can be used for video game programming. 

## Features
- Feature 1
	Once the program is ran, it will display a screen with mouse click user input. 
- Feature 2
	Lets user choose between different customizations for their avatar
- Feature N 
	Allows the user to save a jpg image of their customized avatar. 

## Challenges
- I would need to do more research on using mouseClicked functions. 


## Outcomes
Ideal Outcome:
The ideal outcome is that once the program is running, a display screen will launch and the user will be given the option to customize their own character avatar. They can go back and forth between choosing these customization while it is still running. Once the user is doen customizing their character, they will be given the option to save an jpg image of their avatar.

## Minimal Viable Outcome:
I believe that if this proves to be too challenging, this project will still be viable if it allows the user to pick their character's features at least once. 

